5
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:39.820
Steve and Paul Jobs was born in California in 1955 and adopted by Paul and Clara Jobs.

6
00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:44.460
He became interested in computers in high school, going to after-school lectures at

7
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:50.980
the computer company Hewlett-Packard. He enrolled at Reed College in Oregon. Though he went

8
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:57.660
to a variety of classes, he never graduated. Instead, he moved back to California and began

9
00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:03.120
working at Atari, the video game company. He also started working on his own computer

10
00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:10.620
projects with Steve Wozniak. Jobs and Wozniak, along with Ronald Wayne, founded Apple, named

11
00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:19.320
after Jobs' favorite fruit, in 1976. Apple changed the way people thought about computers.

12
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:25.200
The company made them small, easy to use, and accessible to normal people.

13
00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:32.880
The Macintosh computer was launched in 1984, but sales slowed in 1985, and Jobs was pushed

14
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:40.200
