18
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:08.280
to his original company. He cut programs and Jobs, but he also helped make Apple products

19
00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:15.680
more beloved than ever. Apple has been on a roll ever since, creating elegant, fast,

20
00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.840
computer-friendly products that reflect the vision of Steve Jobs.
